  "summary": "I am a QA Software Engineer focused on improving product quality through thoughtful testing, automation, and close collaboration with engineering and product teams.\n\nMy current work includes manual and automated testing, defect investigation, API and integration validation, release testing, and the development of scalable Playwright automation. I enjoy identifying risks early, finding edge cases, and building processes that help teams release software with greater confidence.\nWith a background in full stack development and deep product experience, I bring both a technical and user-focused perspective to quality engineering. I understand how features are built, how they are used in real-world environments, and where gaps can develop between the two.\n\nLooking ahead, I am focused on continuing to grow in quality engineering, test automation, and software development. My goal is to build reliable testing systems, contribute earlier in the development lifecycle, and help create software that is both technically strong and genuinely useful to the people who rely on it.",
