    "description": "I joined Calldrip in 2020 and have grown with the company through multiple roles, including Technical Support, Support Assistant Manger, Tier II Support, QA, and now QA Software Engineer. Following Calldrip's acquisition by CallRevu, I have continued to expand my responsibilities while helping support the integration and evolution of the platform.\n\nThroughout my career, I have partnered with customers, product managers, and engineering teams to improve software quality, streamline processes, and deliver reliable solutions. My experience spans technical support, quality assurance, API integrations, release validation, technical documentation, and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nToday, as part of CallRevu, I am focused on building scalable quality practices through Playwright automation, improving testing strategies, and helping deliver reliable software by bridging engineering, product, and customer experience.",
